  "scope": [
    "Stream model parameters directly into fixed reusable Wasm banks and incrementally verify SHA256 before publication.",
    "Retain exact validated descriptor, PatchMatch, UNet, head and zone checkpoints on recoverable terminal failures; resume is explicit.",
    "Stream the role ONNX uint8 extent into Wasm and pass that subview to the pinned bounded ORT worker, forwarding child backing ownership without a second global reservation.",
    "Use policy credit for MEMORY_LIMIT and discard cancelled queued checkpoints without clearing a later queued resume.",
    "Admit deterministic combined memory peaks atomically and transfer each lifetime by split; capture only the credits actually returned by failed dynamic CPU attempts. Reuse existing arena banks without requesting a fictitious second output allocation."
  ],
